      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 1907, the town dedicated the Sawin Building, a historic museum that has stored Dover relics for over a century.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        9,
        30
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dover%2C_Massachusetts",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Dover Sun House, designed in 1948 by Eleanor Raymond, was one of the world’s first solar‑heated homes.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
